# claude-seo 运行时与输出产物（不入库）
# /seo setup 会在技能目录内建隔离运行时，这些都是机器本地产物
.claude/skills/seo/.venv/
.claude/skills/seo/ms-playwright/
.claude/skills/seo/runtime-state.json
.claude/skills/seo/drift/
.claude/skills/seo/**/__pycache__/
.claude/skills/seo/**/*.pyc
.claude/settings.local.json

# 凭据 — 永不入库
.env
.env.*
*credentials*.json
*client_secret*.json
